      "comment" : "Spoken message"
    },
    "A few short pages: what's new and what to test. Next and Back move; Skip closes them. The details are in the TurnOver menu (Command Control Comma, then M), under What to test in build %@." : {
      "comment" : "A welcome page after an update: %@ is the build",
